SUMMARY:Duran Decade: Tribute to Duran Duran
DESCRIPTION:Born from a shared obsession with the most stylish band in rock history\, Duran Decade brings the full Duran Duran concert experience to life — the tones\, the gear\, the fashion\, and the swagger. From Planet Earth to Paper Gods\, they span the entire career of the Fab Five. But their heart beats loudest in the Arena era. \nBUY TICKETS\n\n \nBUY TICKETS\n\n\n\n\n\n 
