SUMMARY:Def Leggend: The World's Greatest Tribute to Def Leppard
DESCRIPTION:Def Leggend – The World’s Greatest Tribute to Def Leppard \nDef Leggend is the closest you’ll get to experiencing Def Leppard in their prime. Based in Dallas\, Texas\, this elite tribute act delivers a full-scale arena rock production packed with precision vocals\, authentic visuals\, and high-voltage energy that recreates the sound and feel of a true Leppard show. From “Photograph” and “Rock of Ages” to “Pour Some Sugar on Me” and “Love Bites\,” Def Leggend covers the full spectrum of the band’s chart-topping catalog. But they don’t just play the hits—they perform them with the intensity\, chemistry\, and emotional pull that made Def Leppard one of the biggest rock bands of all time. \nEach member is a seasoned pro with decades of touring experience\, and together they’ve become a national favorite across festivals\, casinos\, theaters\, and city concert series. Their attention to detail in both music and stagecraft sets them apart—this isn’t a costume act or cover band. It’s a full-bodied\, immersive tribute. \nFor fans who grew up on vinyl and MTV… for new audiences discovering the soundtrack of the eighties… Def Leggend is more than a tribute. It’s a revival. A reminder. And one unforgettable night of rock and roll. \nBUY TICKETS\n\n \n\n\n\n\nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/def-leggend-def-leppard-tribute-2026/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:80s Music,Clasic Rock,Featured Event,Music,Pop Rock
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/2026-DefLeggend_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
